natory","sort_order":1,"sense":"簽署者","alt_zh":"成年社區代表圍桌簽署合作文件，隨後各自取一份副本，無可讀文字。","example":"Each signatory kept a copy of the agreement.","example_zh":"每位簽署者都保留一份協議副本。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/signatory-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-silicon-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"silicon","sort_order":1,"sense":"矽","alt_zh":"高中生在科技博物館觀察光亮圓形矽晶圓與放大的電子晶片模型。","example":"The museum displayed a silicon wafer beside an enlarged chip model.","example_zh":"博物館在放大的晶片模型旁展示矽晶圓。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/silicon-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-slaughter-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"slaughter","sort_order":1,"sense":"屠殺","alt_zh":"高中生與老師在莊嚴和平紀念館默哀獻花，無死亡身體、戰鬥或傷害畫面。","example":"The memorial recalled the slaughter of civilians during the war.","example_zh":"紀念館追念戰爭期間遭屠殺的平民。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/slaughter-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-smog-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"smog","sort_order":1,"sense":"霧霾","alt_zh":"從安全室內窗邊看城市，遠處高樓被灰褐霧霾遮蔽，高中生觀察。","example":"A layer of smog obscured the distant city skyline.","example_zh":"一層霧霾遮住遠方城市天際線。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/smog-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-sobriety-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"sobriety","sort_order":1,"sense":"清醒；嚴肅莊重","alt_zh":"高中生在正式紀念典禮上端正站立、神情莊重，老師在旁。","example":"The occasion called for sobriety rather than playful jokes.","example_zh":"這個場合需要嚴肅莊重，不適合開玩笑。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/sobriety-01-v1.webp","local_path":"