象。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/spectacle-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-spectrum-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"spectrum","sort_order":1,"sense":"光譜","alt_zh":"老師在科學教室展示透明三角稜鏡，白光穿過後投射連續彩虹色光帶，無文字。","example":"The prism spread white light into a visible spectrum.","example_zh":"稜鏡把白光分散成可見光譜。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/spectrum-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-splendor-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"splendor","sort_order":1,"sense":"壯麗","alt_zh":"高中訪客從小徑欣賞晨光中的歷史宮殿花園、噴泉與盛開花朵。","example":"The palace garden glowed in the splendor of the morning light.","example_zh":"宮殿花園在晨光中綻放壯麗光彩。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/splendor-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-stalemate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"stalemate","sort_order":1,"sense":"僵局","alt_zh":"兩組成年代表在會議桌兩端各自守著不同建築方案，沉默僵持，主持人思考。","example":"The negotiations reached a stalemate when neither side would change its proposal.","example_zh":"雙方都不願修改提案，談判陷入僵局。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/stalemate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-statute-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"statute","sort_order":1,"sense":"法規","alt_zh":"成年市政人員向高中訪客展示保存歷史建築的正式文件與古城模型，無可讀文字。","example":"The new statute protected the town's historic buildings.","example_zh":"新法規保護城鎮的歷史建築。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/statute-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-sterilize-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"sterilize","sort_order":1,"sense":"