public/word-illustrations/senior/stratification-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-stricken-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"stricken","sort_order":1,"sense":"受災的","alt_zh":"成年救援志工在已安全退水的村落分送食物與毛毯，無傷者或危急畫面。","example":"Volunteers brought supplies to the flood-stricken village.","example_zh":"志工把物資送到受洪水侵襲的村莊。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/stricken-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-subdivision-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"subdivision","sort_order":1,"sense":"細分","alt_zh":"高中生在農業課觀察一塊大田地立體模型，以細小田埂分成數個小田區。","example":"The diagram showed the subdivision of the large field into smaller plots.","example_zh":"圖表呈現大田地細分為小區塊的方式。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/subdivision-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-subjective-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"subjective","sort_order":1,"sense":"主觀的","alt_zh":"兩位高中生看同一幅彩色畫作各自露出不同喜好，友善交換看法。","example":"Her review was subjective because it reflected her own taste in color.","example_zh":"她的評論是主觀的，反映個人對色彩的偏好。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/subjective-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-submission-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"submission","sort_order":1,"sense":"提交","alt_zh":"高中團隊在作品提交櫃臺將包裝妥當的模型橋交給成年工作人員。","example":"The students prepared their model for submission to the competition.","example_zh":"學生準備提交模型參加比賽。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/submission-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-subordination-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"subordination","sort_order":1,"sense":"從屬","alt_zh":"高中生觀察行政組織立體教具，一個中央辦公室模型連接下方多個小辦公室，無文字。","example":"The diagram showed the subordination of the small units to the central office.","example_zh":"圖表顯示小單位從屬於中央辦公室的關係。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/subordination-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-subsidy-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"subsidy","sort_order":1,"sense":"補助金","alt_zh":"成年校方代表接過補助文件，窗外專業技師正在安全屋頂區安裝太陽能板。","example":"The school received a subsidy to install solar panels.","example_zh":"學校獲得補助金，得以安裝太陽能板。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/subsidy-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-substitution-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"substitution","sort_order":1,"sense":"替代","alt_zh":"高中生把模型上的厚重材料替換為輕巧木板，老師在旁協助。","example":"The substitution of a lighter material made the model easier to carry.","example_zh":"換用較輕的材料，讓模型更容易攜帶。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/substitution-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-subtlety-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"subtlety","sort_order":1,"sense":"微妙；細微之處","alt_zh":"高中生在畫廊近看成年人物肖像，臉上有細微溫柔笑意。","example":"The subtlety of her expression made the portrait especially lifelike.","example_zh":"她表情的細微變化讓肖像格外生動。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/subtlety-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-subversion-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"subversion","sort_order":1,"sense":"顛覆","alt_zh":"高中生在圖書館閱讀政治歷史小說，書中插畫為成年人物私下討論改革的房間，無武器或方法細節。","example":"The novel depicted a secret campaign of subversion against the fictional regime.","example_zh":"小說描繪顛覆虛構政權的祕密活動。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/subversion-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-successor-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"successor","sort_order":1,"sense":"繼任者","alt_zh":"成年資深女策展人在展廳向員工介紹成年新策展人，氣氛溫暖。","example":"The retiring curator introduced her successor to the museum staff.","example_zh":"退休策展人向博物館員工介紹繼任者。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/successor-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-suffrage-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"suffrage","sort_order":1,"sense":"選舉權","alt_zh":"高中生在博物館觀看歷史成年女性和平集會與投票的照片，無可讀標語。","example":"The exhibition traced the campaign for women's suffrage.","example_zh":"展覽回顧爭取女性選舉權的運動。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/suffrage-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-superintendent-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"superintendent","sort_order":1,"sense":"總監","alt_zh":"兩位成年教育行政人員沿校園走廊檢查安全設施與教室環境。","example":"The superintendent inspected the school buildings with the principal.","example_zh":"總監與校長一起巡視校舍。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/superintendent-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-superiority-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"superiority","sort_order":1,"sense":"優越","alt_zh":"高中生對比兩座模型橋的相同負重測試，新橋保持穩固、舊模型略彎曲，無崩塌危險。","example":"The new design's superiority became clear during the weight test.","example_zh":"負重測試時，新設計的優越之處清楚顯現。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/superiority-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-supplement-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"supplement","sort_order":1,"sense":"補充品；補充教材","alt_zh":"高中生在課桌上將主課本與配套練習冊並排學習，文字不可